Subject: [PATCH 2/5] Gate cloud LLM routing optimizations

Reason: Cloud jobs use Finoka's routed model budgets and custom knowledge
routes; local jobs must retain the pinned upstream routing behavior.
Removal: Delete after upstream exposes matching routing policy hooks.

